-- entity-core-protocol-unison — seed-policy selection (the keystone §6.9a
-- bootstrap convention). §6.9a pins the invariant (a peer establishes owner
-- authority at init + derives authenticate-time grants from a declared identity →
-- capability seed policy). The cross-peer file format is keystone's
-- (shared/seed-policy/). This is the Unison builder shape.
--
-- The S3 floor mirrors the cohort: `SeedStandard` (the conformant default —
-- `default` → the §4.4 discovery floor) and `SeedDebugOpen` (the degenerate
-- `default` → *, the retired --debug-open-grants). File-parse of the shared JSON
-- schema is the next increment (A-UN-010), not the floor.

type SeedPolicy = SeedStandard | SeedDebugOpen
